#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:584
msgid "Remove image"
msgstr "Eliminar imagen"

#: src/Admin/Editor/SeoMetaBox.php:231
msgid ""
"If empty, Core Blueprint uses the featured image and then the configured "
"default social image."
msgstr ""
"Si está vacío, Core Blueprint usa primero la imagen destacada y después la "
